# Your project's own build artefacts go here.
#
# This template is deliberately language-agnostic, so it does NOT guess at a
# stack -- picking __pycache__/ over node_modules/, bin/, obj/ or target/ would
# be arbitrary. But that means a new project's first test run leaves untracked
# junk to clean by hand before its first commit, which two separate testers hit
# independently. Add your stack's entries below on day one and it never comes up
# again.

# .NET build output
bin/
obj/

# dotnet publish output and built MSI installers - regenerated from source,
# never tracked. installer/Package.wxs itself (the WiX source) is still
# tracked - only its build output is excluded here.
publish/
installer/*.msi
installer/*.wixpdb

# Local dev convenience, not for distribution: pins NuGet to the machine-local
# package cache so restores are provably offline. A public clone must use the
# default sources, so this file must never be committed.
NuGet.Config
